1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It is believed that [https://www.geni.com/people/Anastasia-Irene-Maria-of-Byzantium/6000000003858589577#/tab/overview “the Russian bride”] was either a legal daughter from the wife  [https://www.geni.com/people/Hel
2 CONC ena-Pulcheria-Skleraina/6000000006101358064?through=385935664970005621 Elena Sklirena], or illegitimate from [https://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Skleraina/6000000017809711154?through=385935664970005621 Maria Skleraina]; however, th
2 CONC ere is no mention of the birth of children by Constantine IX Monomachos, Byzantine Emperor. 
2 CONT
