2 CONT ==Nikephoros III Botaneiates==
2 CONT Nikephoros III Botaneiates, Latinized as Nicephorus III Botaniates (Greek: Νικηφόρος Βοτανειάτης, c. 1002[1] – 10 December 1081) was Byzantine emperor from 1078 to 1081. He belonged to a family which claimed descent from the Byzan
2 CONC tine Phokas family.[2]
