2 CONT
2 CONT Prince George
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Rusudan who was married to Prince Jadaron of Alania. They had son David Soslan who would marry Tamar of Georgia
2 CONT
2 CONT Zurab, son of David IV of Georgia
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Tamar, who married Shirvanshah Manuchehr III (died c. 1154), and became a nun in widowhood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Kata, who has been theorized to be the same person as Irene who married the Byzantine prince Isaakios Comnenus.
