2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theodosios_Monomachos Theodosios Monomachos was the grandson of another Theodosios Monomachos, an important bureaucrat under Basil II and Constantine VIII and the '''nephew''' of Emperor Constantine
2 CONC  IX Monomachos, ruler of the Byzantine Empire.[1] In 1056 he was serving as president of the Byzantine Senate, an important administrative role reserved for senior members of the aristocracy.[2]
