2 CONT The purpose of marriages within the Saljuq family was only partly, if at all, political. A rather curious case is the marriage of Alp-Arslan to Toghril Beg’s widow Aka, whom he married on arriving in Ray on Toghril’s death. These 
2 CONC marriages were perhaps sometimes made with the intention of controlling younger members of the family.
