2 CONC (2) Shun [19249], but in XTS, 70B.50b as the 6th son, which is the identification I use. Li(2) Bian [19629], orphaned as a youth, is identified as a Xuzhou resident and as Ke(2)'s descendant--XTS shows no descendants [the whole ge
