1 NOTE {geni:about_me} same profile as https://www.geni.com/people/Vinduyih-ibn-Shapur/6000000033332986085 same profile as https://www.geni.com/people/%D9%88%D9%86%D8%AF%D9%88%DB%8C/6000000028507603044?through=6000000028605894345
2 CONT
2 CONT Vinduyih or Bendoy was a Sasanian nobleman from the Ispahbudhan family. He was the brother of Vistahm.His sister was the mother of Khosrau II, thus making Vinduyih the uncle of Khosrau. Vinduyih and Vistahm played an important rol
2 CONC e in restoring the throne for Khosrau II from Bahram Chobin. He was later deposed in Ctesiphon by the orders of Khosrau II. --------------------
