2 CONT == The Dukas family==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Andronikos Dukas, living ca 1020 (he was related to Emperor Konstantinos (+913)''' but exactly how is uncertain) had issue:
2 CONT *A1. Konstantinos X Dukas, Emperor of Byzantium (1059-67), +1067; 1m: a dau.of Konstantinos Dalassenos; 2m: before 1050 Eudokia Makrembolitissa (+1096)
2 CONT ** ...
