2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Vsevolod I (married in 1046) and princess Anastasia of Byzantium (d. 1067), daughter of Emperor Constantine IX Monomachos, from whom he takes his nickname of Monomakh (Greek: "One who fights alone").
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora (Maria) var prinsesse av Bysants. 
