2 CONT >2.         IZIASLAV Vladimirovich (1077-killed in battle Murom 6 Sep 1096, bur Novgorod St Sophia).  The Primary Chronicle names Iziaslav, son of Vladimir, recording that he arrived at Murom from Kursk in 1095[393].  Prince of Su
2 CONC zdal.  The Primary Chronicle records that he was killed fighting Oleg Sviatoslavich, and his burial place[394]. 
