2 CONT Loud, Graham A. The Age of Robert Guiscard: Southern Italy and the Norman Conquest. 2000. 
2 CONT Loud, Graham A. "Coinage, Wealth and Plunder in the Age of Robert Guiscard." The English Historical Review, Vol. 114, No. 458. (Sep., 1999), pp 815-843. 
2 CONT Bloch, Herbert. "Monte Cassino, Byzantium, and the West in the Earlier Middle Ages." Dumbarton Oaks Papers, Vol. 3. (1946), pp 163-224. 
2 CONT Skinner, Patricia. "'Halt! Be Men!': Sikelgaita of Salerno, Gender, and the Norman Conquest of Italy". Gender and History, 12:3 (2000). 
2 CONT Comnena, Anna. The Alexiad. trans. Elizabeth A. Dawes. London, 1928. 
2 CONT Peterson-Gouma, Thalia. Anna Komnene and Her Times. 2000. 
2 CONT Garland, Lynda. Byzantine Empresses. 1999. 
