2 CONT
2 CONT Relationships:
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *Father: Robert "Guiscard" or "The Weasel" de Hauteville, Duke of Apulia, Calabria, and Sicily (c1020 - 17 July 1085)
2 CONT *Mother: Sichelgaita (or "Gaita") di Salerno (c1040 - 27 July 1090)
2 CONT
2 CONT Half-Siblings:
2 CONT *1. Marco or Bohemond of Apulia, Prince of Antioch (1052 - 1111)
2 CONT *2. Emma (b. c 1045) wife of Marchese Odo "le Bon"
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT *1. Mathilde or Mahalta of Apulia (c1059 - after 6 June 1112), wife of Ramon Berenguer II "Cap d'Estopes", Conde de Barcelona 1078-1082, and wife of Amaury I, Vicomte de Narbonne (1085 onward)
2 CONT *3. Mabel of Apulia, wife of Guillaume de Grantmesnil (m. 1088/1096)
2 CONT *4. Eria of Apulia, wife of Ugo d'Este or Hugues V, Comte du Maine (m. 1078 and later divorced).
2 CONT *5. Robert of Apulia (d. after May 1103)
2 CONT *6. Guy of Apulia, Duca di Amalfi e Sorrento (d. 5 July 1108)
2 CONT *7. Sibylle of Apulia wife of Ebles II, Comte de Roucy (m. before 1082)
2 CONT *8. Olympias of Apulia (d. after 1090), betrothed to Konstantinos Dukas, co-Emperor of Byzantium (Aug. 1074 - 1078, baptized Helena)
2 CONT *9. Cecile of Apulia
2 CONT *10. Gaitelgrima of Apulia (d. after 1086), wife of Drogo, then wife of Onfroi, Conti di Sarno.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses and partners with Children:
