2 CONT **2. Guillaume of Apulia, Duke of Apulia, Calabria, and Sicily (c. 1096 - 25 July 1127), husband of Gaitelgrima di Airola (m. May 1115, d. 1117), and Gaitelgrima di Capua (m. 1120, d. after 1127)
2 CONT **3. Guiscard of Apulia (d. August 1108)
2 CONT * Unknown Mistress
2 CONT **1. Guillaume, Conte di Gesualdo e Lucera (d. c.1150)
