2 CONT *[360] WT XIV.IX, p. 619. 
2 CONT *[361] Tudebodus Imitatus, p. 171. 
2 CONT *[362] Houben (2002), p. 21. 
2 CONT *[363] Romoaldi Annales 1101, MGH SS XIX, p. 413. 
2 CONT *[364] Romoaldi Annales 1092, MGH SS XIX, p. 412. 
2 CONT *[365] Malaterra, IV.20, p. 98. 
2 CONT *[366] Romoaldi Annales 1115, MGH SS XIX, p. 415. 
2 CONT *[367] Romoaldi Annales 1092, MGH SS XIX, p. 412. 
2 CONT *[368] Malaterra, IV.21, p. 100. 
2 CONT *[369] Romoaldi Annales 1092, MGH SS XIX, p. 412. 
2 CONT *[370] WT XIV.IX, p. 619. 
2 CONT *[371] Cronica di Romualdo Guarna arcivescovo Salernitano (Chronicon Romualdi II archiepiscopi Salernitani) ("Romualdo Guarna"), Re, G. del (ed.) (1845) Cronisti e scrittori sincroni Napoletani, Vol. 1 (Napoli), p. 6. 
2 CONT *[372] The sharing arrangement was made by Robert "Guiscard" after the capture of Palermo in 1072. 
2 CONT *[373] Annales Casinenses 1127, MGH SS XIX, p. 308. 
2 CONT *[374] Romualdo Guarna, 1126, p. 6. 
