2 CONT 6.         [ERIA] of Apulia .  Orderic Vitalis records that “Hugo” had married “filiam Roberti Wiscardi” but had repudiated her, for which Pope Urban II had excommunicated him[339].  Her father's insistance that his principal vass
2 CONC als meet the cost of her wedding caused considerable resentment, triggering the revolt against Robert Guiscard in autumn 1078.  Amatus records the marriage of Duke Robert's (unnamed) daughter, endowed "with a very fine dowry", and
2 CONC  the (unnamed) son of Marquis Azzo[340].  The primary source which confirms her name has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT *m (1078, divorced) as his second wife, UGO d'Este [HUGUES [V] Comte du Maine], son of ALBERTO AZZO II d'Este & his second wife Gersende du Maine. 
