2 CONT 7.         ROBERT of Apulia (-after May 1103).  The Annals of Romoald name (in order) "Rogerium et Robbertum atque Guidonem" as the three sons of Robert "Guiscard" & his second wife[341].  "…Robertus ducis filius…" was among the s
