2 CONC al-Daula Ali, was with Sanjar at the battle of Qatvan and was killed in the engagement. His two daughter were sent back to Yazd with Rukn al-Din Sam as their atabeg. Garchasp apparently had another daughter Ata Khatun, who was mar
2 CONC ried to Mahmud b. Muhammad.
