2 CONT Romanos I Lekapenos or Romanus I Lecapenus (Greek: Ρωμανός Α΄ Λακαπήνος, Rōmanos I Lakapēnos) (c. 870 – June 15, 948) was Byzantine Emperor from 920 to his deposition on December 16, 944.
