2 CONT [edit] Family
2 CONT
2 CONT By his marriage to Theodora (who died in 922), Romanos had six children, including:
2 CONT
2 CONT Christopher Lekapenos, co-emperor from 921 to 931, who was married to the Augusta Sophia and was the father of Maria (renamed Eirene), who married Peter I of Bulgaria; Christopher's son Michael Lekapenos may have been associated a
2 CONC s co-emperor by his grandfather. 
