2 CONT ==Rostislav Vsevolodovich==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rostislav Vsevolodovich (Russian: Ростислав Всеволодович) (1070–1093)''' was the Prince of Pereyaslavl (1078–1093), son of Vsevolod I of Kiev and half brother of Vladimir Monomakh.
