2 CONT      Jarislaus I, Grand Duke of Kiev was the son of St. Vladimir I, Grand Duke of Kiev.2 He married Ingegarde of Sweden, daughter of Olof Skötkonung, King of Sweden.3 He died in 1054.2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Jarislaus I, Grand Duke of Kiev also went by the nick-name of Jarislaus 'the Wise' (?).2 He gained the title of Grand Duke Jarislaus I of Kiev in 1019.1,2
