1 NOTE 867789532. Storfyrste Isiaslav I N.NSON Kiev (20736) was born in 1025. (20737) He was a Storfyrste in 1054 in Kiev. (20738) He died 3.10.1078 drept.(20739) Landflyktig i Polen 1068-69 og 1073-74. He was married to Gertrud N.NSDTR 
2 CONC av Polen about 1043.(20740)
