2 CONT 9.         '''GAITELGRIMA''' (-[Jun 1104/9 Dec 1108]).  The Annals of Romoald record the marriage in 1077 of "filiam Guaimarii princeps Salernitani" and "Riccardus princeps"[1054].  According to William of Apulia, "Gaitelgrima" da
2 CONC ughter of Prince Guaimar IV married Jordan Prince of Capua[1055].  The Gestis Ducum Normannorum names "Gatteclina soror eius [=Sichelgaitæ] minor" as the wife of "Iordani principi Capuæ filio Ricardi senioris"[1056].  Robert Princ
2 CONC e of Capua donated property to San Paolo di Aversa for the souls of "quondam principum Richardi…avi et Jourdani patris nec non Richardi fratris nostri et matris nostre Gaytelgrime" by charter dated 9 Dec 1108[1057].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly (1077) JORDAN Prince of Capua, son of RICHARD Prince of Capua, Count of Aversa & his first wife Fredesende de Hauteville ([1045/50]-Feb 1091).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly ([1091/93]) UGO di Faida, son of --- (-Mar 1121). 
