2 CONT
2 CONT     * Aubé, Pierre. Roger II de Sicile. Un Normand en Méditerranée. Payot, 2001.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Houben, Hubert (translated by Graham A. Loud and Diane Milburn). Roger II of Sicily: Ruler between East and West. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 2002.
