2 CONT *[364] Florentii Wigornensis Monachi Chronicon, p. 3. 
2 CONT *[365] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, X, pp. 69-72, and XI, p. 72. 
2 CONT *[366] Chronicon Roskildense, X, p. 23. 
2 CONT *[367] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, XI, p. 72. 
2 CONT *[368] Malmesbury, 261, p. 245. 
2 CONT *[369] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, XV, pp. 84-5. 
2 CONT *[370] Chronicon Roskildense, X, p. 24. 
2 CONT *'''[371] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, XI, p. 72.'''
2 CONT *'''[372] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, XIV, p. 86.'''
2 CONT *[373] Saxo Grammaticus (Christiansen), 11, XI, p. 72. 
