2 CONT 1.         LOUIS of Apulia (-shortly before 2 Sep 1094).  The Annals of Romoald name (in order) "Ludovicum et Guiscardum, qui in puerilibus annos mortui, [et] Gulielmus" as the sons of "Rogerius dux" and his wife[371].  Malaterra 
