2 CONT a)         GUILLAUME [II] de Grantmesnil (-[3 Oct], 1118 or after).  Orderic Vitalis names “Guillelmum et Rodbertum” as the two sons of Guillaume de Grantmesnil and his wife[381].  He succeeded his father but did not long survive 
2 CONC him[382].  "La contessa Mabilia, vedova del protosebasta Guglielmo di Grantmesnil ed il figlio Guglielmo" donated the church of San Pietro di Bragalla to Cava by charter dated Sep 1117[383].  The possibility of his death “3 Oct” i
2 CONC s discussed under his possible wife Agatha.  
