2 CONT Maria of Bulgaria abdicated her throne shortly after taking over the government after her husband John Vladislav died.  Her country was taken over by Basil II of the Byzantine Empire.  The Second Bulgaria Kingdom didn't begin unti
2 CONC l 1186 when the brothers Peter and Ivan Asen took over from the Byzantines.
