2 CONT 2.      '''   IRINA Volodarovna'''.  The Primary Chronicle records that the daughter of Volodar was taken to Tsargrad 20 Jul 1104 to become the wife of the son of Emperor Alexios[622].  The typikon of Theotokos Kecharitomenes (dat
2 CONC ed to [1110]) provides for the future commemoration of "la...bru de ma Majesté, la sébastocratorissa kyra Irène" on the date of her death[623].  
