1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tamar had also married and was the widower of the Sultan of Ardebil, an ancestor of Shah Ismail SAFAVI. ref: page 103 of  https://archive.org/details/Minorsky1953StudiesCaucasianHistory/page/n105
