1 NAME Vasak /Pahlavuni/ Prince of Paperon
2 GIVN Vasak
2 SURN Pahlavuni
2 NSFX Prince of Paperon
2 _MARNM Pahlavuni
2 NICK Vasak of Barbaron
2 NICK Lord of Askuras
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1199
1 OCCU Prince of Paperon
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ARMENIA.htm#SempadBarbarondied1153B
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         VACAHK (-after 1198).  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad names "Vaçag frère de Pagouran, et seigneur de la forteresse d'Asgouras et de Lamos"[940].  Lord of Askuras.  Smbat Sparapet's Chr
2 CONC onicle names "…the prince of Paperon, Bakuran, the prince of Askuras, Vasak…" among those present at the coronation of King Leo in [31 Jan 1198/30 Jan 1199][941].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Vacaghk's wife is not known.  Vacaghk & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         KOSTANDIN ([1180]-[15 Jan 1262/14 Jan 1263]).  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad records that "Constantin, fils de Vaçag, oncle maternel du roi" rescued the king's first wife from his an
2 CONC ger in [29 Jan 1205/28 Jan 1206][942].  The Lignages d'Outremer records that "Constantin le Connétable…le fils de l'oncle de Leon et seigneur de Partzerpert et de Baberon" was appointed "baile" after the death of "Adam le seigneur
2 CONC  de Menyan"[943].  He succeeded as '''Lord of Barbaron''' and Partzerpert.   -        see below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *b)         SMBAT (-after 1199).  Rüdt-Collenberg cites sources which confirm Smbat's parentage[944]. ''' Lord of Saravantikar'''. -        LORDS of SARAVANTIKAR.  
