2 CONT
2 CONT '''Qarin II''' (Persian: کارین‎‎), was the ruler of the Bavand dynasty from 1057 to 1074. He was the son of a certain Surkhab, who was possibly the son of the Bavandid ruler Shahriyar III. Not much more is known about Qarin II; he
2 CONC  died in 1074, and was succeeded by his son Shahriyar IV.
2 CONT
