1 NOTE Constantine VII Porphyrogenitus (905-959) Byzantine emperor, son of Le o VI. Although he was crowned emperor in 911, for over 30 years he wa s overshadowed by his father-in-law, the regent Romanus Lacapenus, wh o created his own s
