1 OCCU Drottning/Dronning av Sverige, Reina Consorte de Suecia, Princesse des Obotrides, Queen Consort of Sweden (1000-1022), Queen Consort of Sweden, Queen/Princess, Princess of the Obotrites Queen of sweeden, Dronning, Astrid, Dronning
