2 CONT
2 CONT Niklot	1131–1160	Born around 1090. Also ruled the subdued Polabian Slav tribes of Kessinians and Circipanians.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pribislav	1160–1167	Last Obotrite prince. Accepted Saxon suzerainty in 1167.
2 CONT
2 CONT The rulers of Obotrite lands were later the dukes and grand dukes of Mecklenburg.
