2 CONT Jim Weber writes:  Carol Collins, citing Henry Drummond's  History of Noble British Families , gave the descent of the Drummonds through George, son of Andrew. Todd Farmerie, quite knowledgeable in such matters, stated that he had
2 CONC  never seen any mention of a such a son George, and considered it an invention.
2 CONT
2 CONT Since I already have a connection to King Andrew through his daughter Adelaide, I will keep George as a Drummond ancestor.
