1 NOTE 859747694. Storfyrste Sviatopolk II. Michel ISIASLAVSON av Kiev was born in 1050.(20077) He was a Fyrste in 1078 in Novgorod.(20078) He was a Storfyrste in 1093 in Kiev. (20079) He died on 16 Apr 1113.
1 NOTE Not Married
1 NOTE 859747690. Grev Henrik POPPOSON av Berg-Schelkingen (20068) died on 24 Sep. (20069) Ble bisatt i kloster Zweifalten. He was a Greve in Berg-Schelkingen. (20070) Han gjorde sig fortjent ved sammen med sin hustru Adelheid å gi 6 ga
2 CONC ̊rder til klostret Zweifalten. han var til slutt munk i klostret og bisatt der. He was married to Adelheid N.NSDTR av Mochental.
