2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Evpraksya Izyaslavna of Kiev 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Evpraksya was born in 1072 in Turov, Polbesye, Byelorussia.1   Evpraksya's father was Grand Duke of Kiev Izyaslav Dmitrij Yaroslavich I and her mother was Gertruda of Poland.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Her paternal grandparents were Grand Prince of Kiev Jaroslav Rurik of Kiev I and Ingigerd Olafsdottir; 
2 CONT
2 CONT her maternal grandparents were King Mieszko Lambert Piast of Poland II and Countess Richenza of Palatinate-Lorraine. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She had six brothers named Mstislav, Yaropolk, Svyatopolk, Svyatoslav, Vsevolod and Igor.  She was the youngest of the seven children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
