2 CONT Marriages and family:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I was betrothed to Matilda, the daughter of the Emperor Conrad II (1024–39), but she died prematurely in 1034. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I then married Matilda, daughter of Liudolf, Margrave of Frisia, but she died in 1044, following a Caesarean section. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Casting further afield in search of a third wife, Henry I married Anne of Kiev on 19 May 1051. They had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Philip I ( 23 May 1052 – 30 July 1108)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Emma (1054–?)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.Robert (c. 1055–c. 1060)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.Hugh the Great (1057–1102)
