2 CONT Marriages[edit]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I was betrothed to Matilda, the daughter of Conrad II, Holy Roman Emperor, but she died prematurely in 1034. Henry then married Matilda of Frisia, but she died in 1044, following a Caesarean section. Casting further afield i
2 CONC n search of a third wife, Henry married Anne of Kiev on 19 May 1051. They had four children: 1.Philip I (23 May 1052 – 30 July 1108) 2.Emma (born 1054, date of death unknown) 3.Robert (c. 1055 – c. 1060) 4.Hugh "the Great" of Verm
2 CONC andois (1057–1102)
2 CONT
