1 NOTE He was the leader of the first Crusade.  Called the Great, duke of France.
1 NOTE Hugh was one of the illustrious seven leaders of the first crusade. Hewas Duke of France and Burgundy, Marquise of Orleans, Count of Valois andVermandois.
2 CONT Sources:  Browning's Colonial Dames of Royal Descent, pp. 28, 277-8.
2 CONT      Families Descended from All Royal Families, by Elizabeth Leach
2 CONT      Rexford, pp. 154-7.
2 CONT      Americans of Royal Descent--Browning, pp. 28-9.
2 CONT      Magna Charta, by John S. Wurts. Part 3, pp. 566-572. Parts 1 and 2,
2 CONT      pp. 213-219--English Kings Edwards I, II, III.
2 CONT      Lines of Mellcene Thurman Smith.  genealogylibrary.com
