2 CONT '''Evfrosiniya Princess Of Kiev''' [Queen Of Hungar-16780 [Parents] was born in 1130 in Of, Kiev, Kiev, Ukraine. She died in 1186 in , Byzantium, , Turkey. She was buried in , Szekesfehervar, Fejer, Hungary. 
