1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guaimario_III_di_Salerno
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SOUTHERN%20ITALY,%20PRE-NORMAN.htm#GuaimarIIISalernodied1030
