2 CONC  meo et Drogoni et Uberto toti tres biscerali filii mei, atque mundualdi", by charter dated Feb 1098, witnessed by "Guidelmo archipresbiter, Drogoni et Ubberto qui sumus filii predicte domine, Augeri iener qui sum Guidelmo filius 
2 CONC Roberto…"[174].  Archipresbiter.  "Rocca filia Drogoni comiti" donated property to Monte Cassino, in the presence of "domino Robbertus de Bachonis gener meus", by charter dated Jul 1112, witnessed by "Widelmus…archipresbytero…Drag
2 CONC o filio domine Rocce, Widelmus Calcavilla…"[175]. 
