2 CONT 4.         GUILLAUME de Hauteville "Bras de Fer" ([1010/20]-[May/Sep] 1046, bur Venosa, Monastery of Santissima Trinità) ... ... ...
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/178529091/william-de_hauteville
2 CONT
2 CONT One of twelve sons of Tancred of Hauteville and Muriella of Normandy. He married Guida, a daughter of Guy, duke of Sorrento. In 1045, he was defeated near Taranto by Argyrus. He died in early 1046 and was succeeded by his brother 
2 CONC Drogo.
