2 CONT 1.         ROBERTO (-1099).  The Annals of Romoald name "Wilhelmus de Sancto Nicandro [filius Tancredi] pater Robberti comitis de Principatu"[490].  "…Robertus ducis nepos…" was among the subscribers of the charter dated 19 Feb 10
2 CONC 76 under which "Rotbertus dux" made concessions to the cathedral of Santa Maria at Melfi[491].  He witnessed his father's 1080 will[492].  He succeeded his father in 1080 as Conte di Principato.  "Robertus…Comes Salerni Principatu
2 CONC s, filius quondam Domini Comitis Guillielmi" confirmed the rights of the archbishop of Salerno by charter dated Jun 1090 which names "Domine Gilie…conjuncis nostre"[493].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' GILIA, daughter of RAINONE "Brito" & his wife Atta ---.  "Robertus…Comes Salerni Principatus, filius quondam Domini Comitis Guillielmi" confirmed the rights of the archbishop of Salerno by charter dated Jun 1090 which name
2 CONC s "Domine Gilie…conjuncis nostre"[494].  "Ralnolfus qui vocor Brictone…et Atta uxor mea et Johel filius meus" donated property to Cava by charter dated Oct 1086[495].  Her parentage is confirmed by a charter dated Apr 1101 under w
2 CONC hich "Guilielmi comitis principatus" called Rainulf "Brito" his "avunculus"[496].  Robert & his wife had one child:  
