2 CONC d Sicily'']. Jefferson, NC, USA: McFarland & Co. pp. 110, 116-17, 134, 178, 206.
2 CONT * '''Brown, Paul'''. (2016). [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Mercenaries_to_Conquerors/4MqHDQAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=Judith+d%27Évreux&pg=PT61&printsec=frontcover ''Mercenaries to Conquerors: Norman Warfare in the Eleventh an
2 CONC d Twelfth Century Mediterranean'']. Barnsley, South Yorkshire, UK, Pen & Sword Books.
2 CONT * '''Fernández-Aceves, Hervin'''. (2020). [https://www.google.com/books/edition/County_and_Nobility_in_Norman_Italy/Ujj1DwAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=Judith+d%27Évreux&pg=PA268&printsec=frontcover ''County and Nobility in Norman Italy:
