2 CONT *long thought to be the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Edgar-Uncrowned-King-of-England/6000000000441407153, 
2 CONT *but now thought more likely to have been a daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Ruggero-I-d-Altavilla-gran-conte-di-Sicilia/6000000000559573962, and his third wife, Adelaide del Vasto. Patrick Deret, however, alleges, on the b
2 CONC asis of possible birth dates, that her mother must have been Roger's second wife, Eremburga of Mortain. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guigues_III_of_Albon
