2 CONT SMBAT, son of VACAGHK Lord of Barbaron & his wife --- (-after 1199).  Rüdt-Collenberg cites sources which confirm Smbat's parentage[1237].  Lord of Saravantikar.  Smbat Sparapet's Chronicle names "…the prince of Sarvandikar, Smbat
2 CONC …" among those present at the coronation of King Leo in [31 Jan 1198/30 Jan 1199][1238]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Smbat's wife is not known. 
