1 NOTE Serbian Grand Župan
2 CONT Stefan Nemanja (1113\1117-13 February 1199\1200) was a Medieval Serb nobleman, descended from the Vukanovic who was Grand Prince of the medieval Serb state of Rascia in 1168-1196. He established control over the territories of nei
2 CONC ghboring Serb states, including Zeta/Doclea, and unified them into a single state. He founded the Nemanjic dynasty and became an Orthodox Saint (Symeon) after numerous miracles following his death.
2 CONT Spouse = Ana
