2 CONT
2 CONT The Primary Chronicle records that Boleslav of Poland fled from Kiev in 1018 with Iaroslav's two sisters[107].
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Russian Wikipedia page of her father, Vladimir Svyatoslavich:
