1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >===[https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/RUSSIA,%20Rurik.htm#_Toc481496211 Medlands: Russia]
2 CONT >'''Grand Prince Vladimir had nine illegitimate children by unknown Mistresses (3) to (9): ''' 
2 CONT >13. SUDISLAV Vladimirovich (-Kiev [1062/63], bur Church of St George).  
2 CONT >– The ''Primary Chronicle'' names (in order) Vysheslav, Izyaslav, Yaroslav, Sviatopolk, Vsevolod, Sviatoslav, Mstislav, Boris, Gleb, Stanislav, Pozvizd and Sudislav as the twelve sons of Vladimir[140].
2 CONT >– Prince of Pskov.
2 CONT >– He was imprisoned by his half-brother Iaroslav Grand Prince of Kiev in [1034/36][141]. 
2 CONT >– The ''Primary Chronicle'' records his release from prison after 24 years in 1059 by Izyaslav, Sviatoslav and Vsevolod and his taking the monastic habit, and his death in [1062/63] and place of burial[142].
2 CONT
