2 CONC thdrawal.  During Sviatoslav's absence in Bulgaria, the Pechenegs raided as far as Kiev.  Fine points out that according to the Primary Chronicle the Bulgarians summoned the Pechenegs to attack Kiev, without help from Byzantium.  
