2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Oleg Sviatoslavich (d. 976/977, killed, buried in Vruchiy, Prince of Dereva)
2 CONT
2 CONT Grand Prince Sviatoslav had one illegitimate child by Mistress (2):
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Vladimir Sviatoslavich (b. c.960, d. 15 July 1015 in Berestove, Grand Prince of Kiev as Vladimir The Great, OUR ANCESTOR)
