2 CONT
2 CONT      Astrid (?) is the daughter of Olof Skötkonung, King of Sweden and Astrid (?). She married Saint Olav II Haraldsson, King of Norway, son of Harald Grenske, King of Westfold and Asta Gudbransdotter, in 1019.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Haraldsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Astrid (?) and Saint Olav II Haraldsson, King of Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Wulfhild (?) d. 1071
2 CONT
