2 CONC ncestry Family Trees Repository R-2041639490 Name: Ancestry.com Source S-2041639488 Repository: #R-2041639490 Title: Ancestry Family Trees Repository R-2041639490 Name: Sigrid "the Proud" /Storrada/ Given Name: Sigrid "the Proud" 
2 CONC Surname: Storrada Nickname: the Proud 
