2 CONT      Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia was the son of '''Geisa I Arpád, King of Hungary''' and '''Synadene Synadenos'''*?*. (1) He married '''Predslava of Kiev''', daughter of Svyatopolk I, Grand Duke of Kiev, in 1104. (1) 
2 CONT *He died in 1129. (1)
2 CONT *     Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia gained the title of Prince Almus of Hungary. (2) He gained the title of Duke of Croatia.
2 CONT *Child of Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia
2 CONT # Hedwig Arpád (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT *Children of Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia and Predslava of Kiev
2 CONT # Adelheid Arpád+ d. 1140 (1)
2 CONT # Elisabeth Arpád+ d. a 1150 (3)
2 CONT # Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary+ b. c 1109, d. 1141 (1)
