2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Bela II (Masodik Tak) "The Blind" King Of HUNGARY b: 1108 in Of, Esztergom, Komaron-Esztergom, Hungary
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Erzsebet Princess Of HUNGARY b: Abt 1128 in Of, Esztergom, Komarom-Esztergom, Hungary
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Hedvig, Princess Of HUNGARY b: After 1108 in Of, Esztergom, Komarom-Esztergom, Hungary
2 CONT
