2 CONT Zbyslava of Kiev
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Zbyslava of Kiev (Russian: Сбыслава Ярославна, Polish: Zbysława Kijowska; b. ca. 1085/90 - d. ca. 1112/14), was a Kievan Rus' princess member of the Rurikid dynasty and by marriage Duchess of Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Sviatopolk II, Grand Prince of Kiev by his first wife, who is believed was a Premyslid princess.[1]
