1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Bolesław II the Generous''' ('''the Bold''') (born around 1042, died on April 2 or 3, 1081 or 1082) – '''prince of Poland''' in the years 1058 - 1076, '''king of Poland''' 1076-1079. http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki
2 CONC /Boles%C5%82aw_II_Szczodry
