2 CONT He was the firstborn son of Casimir the Restorer and Dobroniega, daughter of Vladimir I the Great, Grand Duke of Kiev. Brother of Władysław I Herman. He was named after his great-grandfather Bolesław I the Brave.
2 CONT
2 CONT The exact date of birth of Bolesław II is unknown. Historians usually favor the year 1042[1].
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolesław_II_the_Bold
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Polish prince from 1058 King of Poland from 1076 Banished from the country after April 11, 1079.
