1 NOTE {geni:about_me} FEODOSIA, PRINCESS OF CHERNIGOV
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Primary Chronicle" names David, son of Sviatoslav, recording that he left Novgorod for Smolensk "toward the close of the year" in 1095.  Initially a Prince of Novgorod, David Sviatoslavich was installed as Prince of Smolensk 
2 CONC in 1094.  Under the family accord at Liubech in 1097, he became Prince of Chernigov.  Married Feodosia, daughter of _______."  
2 CONT
2 CONT David Svyatoslavich and Feodosia had five children --
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.) Sviatoslav Davidovich / Prince of Lutsk (circa 1080 - between 1142 / 1145) who married Anna Sviatopolkovna of Kiev
2 CONT
