2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ^ "SAVOY", Foundation for Medieval Genealogy. June 2010. Retrieved sept 15 2010.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. ^ "The Early History of the House of Savoy", CUP Archive. p. 197.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. ^ "MONFERRATO, Saluzzo", Foundation for Medieval Genealogy. March 2010. Retrieved 15 sept 2010.
2 CONT
