2 CONC ese di Savona, son of Teuto II, Markgraf von Montferrat and Erbin von Vasto und Busco, Markgräfin von Montferrat Bertha von Turin, after 1111; His 3rd. Her 3rd.2,3 Agnes de Vermandois died after 1125.4
