2 CONT He married in 1104: 1) Lucienne de Rochefort — the marriage was annulled.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Isabelle (c.1105 – before 1175), married (ca 1119) William of Vermandois, seigneur of Chaumont 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married in 1115: 2) Adélaide de Maurienne (1092–1154)
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philip (1116 – 13 October 1131), King of France (1129–31), not to be confused with his brother of the same name; died from a fall from a horse. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis VII (1120 – 18 September 1180), King of France 
2 CONT
