2 CONT
2 CONT Constance (ca 1124 – 16 August 1176), married first Eustace IV, count of Boulogne and then Raymond V of Toulouse. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philip (1125–61), bishop of Paris. not to be confused with his elder brother. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter of France (ca 1125–83), married Elizabeth, lady of Courtenay 
