2 CONT "Pedigree Resource File," database, FamilySearch (http://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.2.1/9CHR-82S : accessed 2014-04-20), entry for Bertrade de Montfort Queen of France, submitted by sboylan3765059.<nowiki>--------------------------
