2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hertug Knut Eriksen Lavard married Ingeborg Mstislavsdtr of Novgorod, daughter of Storfyrste Mstislav I. Vladimirsen Kiev and Fyrstinne Kristin Ingesdtr. He married Ingelborg Haraldsdtr Holmgard, daughter of Harald Valdemarsen Hol
2 CONC mgard and Kristin Ingesdtr. He was born in 1096 at Jylland syd, Denmark. He was Hertug. He ble drept av sitt søskenbarn kong Magnus. He died on 7 Jan 1131 at
2 CONT
2 CONT Jylland syd, Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Mstislavsdtr of Novgorod was born at Kiev, Russia. She married Hertug Knut Eriksen Lavard, son of Erik I. Knutsen Eiegod and Bodil Torgautsdtr. She died at Sweden.
2 CONT
