1 NOTE Stephen III of Hungary, called the Lightening, returned to reclaim his throne from his cousin, Stephen IV in 1165.  Stephen III's 2nd reign lasted until 1173.  He was succeeded by Bela IV. who became King Bela III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen III of Hungary came to the throne after his father Geza III died in 1161.  Stephen was driven out by his uncles Ladislas and Stephen IV, who ruled until 1164, when Stephen III returned and regained the throne.  He then die
2 CONC d in 1173, and was succeeded by Bela III.
1 NOTE He ruled from 1161 to 1172. He had to contend with his nephew, the sons of Bela II, Ladislas II and Stephen IV, who deposed him twice. Anarchy lasted until 1165 when they were dead.
