1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landulf_V_of_Benevento
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Landulf V''' (died September 1033) was the prince of Benevento from May 987, when he was first associated with his father Pandulf II, to his death. He was chief prince from his father's death in 1014.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SOUTHERN%20ITALY,%20PRE-NORMAN.htm#LandolfVBeneventodied1033B
2 CONT
2 CONT '''LANDOLF di Capua''', son of PANDOLF III Prince of Capua & his wife --- (-Sep 1034).  The Annales Beneventani record that "domni Pandolfi et…domni Landolfi filii eius" were expelled from Benevento in 1003 and replaced as prince 
2 CONC by "Adelferium de Abellino"[278].  The calculation of the regnal years of "Landolfi filii eius [=domini Pandolfi]" in the Annales Beneventani suggests that he was installed as joint Prince of Benevento, jointly with his father, in
2 CONC  [987][279].  LANDOLF V Prince of Benevento.  The Chonicon Monasterii Beneventani records the death in Sep 1034 of "Landulphus Princeps"[280]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---CARDA, daughter of MANSO II Duke of Amalfi & his wife --- ([982/87]-[1004/09], bur Benevento San Pietro).  The epitaph of "---carda…Landulfi…uxor proles Mansonis…ducis" records that she died aged 22, and was buried at B
2 CONC enevento San Pietro[281]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Duke Landolf & his wife had two children:
2 CONT
