2 CONT ''redundant notes of the above, from   new 2024 user   https://www.geni.com/people/Jakob-Alan-Marino-Dudgeon/6000000202867940850 :''
2 CONT
2 CONT Not sure why Sigelgaita is considered the daughter of Landolfo “the Red” when the PRE-NORMAN.htm source doesn’t state who her parents were from what I can tell. From my understanding the PRE-NORMAN.htm source is the one to go by. 
2 CONC The genealogics.org source states Wanzia was Landolfo’s wife but the PRE-NORMAN.htm source states that Landolfo’s wife was Maria di Gaeta with good reason supported by someone named Stasser. Stasser also states that the source for
2 CONC  Landolfo and Yvantia showing as married is a “late and spurious (fake) source”. Apparently there is no earlier source supporting Wanzia being Landolfo’s wife other than the one that Stasser says is late and spurious (fake).
2 CONT
2 CONT
