2 CONC ni filii sui", which names "domnus Paldulfus…genitor supradicti domni…seniori"[1144].  A charter dated Aug 1056 names "domne Theodore filie domne Gregorii consulis et ducis Romanorum, que fuerat uxor Paldulfi…filius…domni Guaimari
2 CONC i principis…et Guaimarii et Gregorii et Iohannis et Guidonis filii ipsius domne Theodore et iamdicti Paldulfi"[1145].  A charter dated Jul 1068 records that "Ursus et Petrus germani…fils du défunt Alfan avec leurs épouses Fresa et
2 CONC  Laita" donated property to the church of San Michele Arcangelo di Venanzana near Capaccio which belonged to "domne Theodore et domni Guaimarii et Gregorii et Guidoni et Iohannes germani filii quondam domni Paldulfi et prefate The
2 CONC odore"[1146].  Signore di Cappaccio.  "Johannes filius bone memorie Paldulfi filii domini Guaimarii principis et Ageltruda uxor eius filia Landolfi comitis Sesse civitatis" are named in a charter dated 1083[1147].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly AGELTRUDA di Suessa, daughter of LANDOLF [IV] Conte di Suessa & his wife --- (after 1050-before 1100).  "Johannes filius bone memorie Paldulfi filii domini Guaimarii principis et Ageltruda uxor eius filia Landolfi 
2 CONC comitis Sesse civitatis" are named in a charter dated 1083[1148].  
