2 CONC by which marriage they were born[869].  Her marriage is suggested by the Gesta Roberti Wiscardi which names "Robertus de Scabioso Monte comes…Gosfredi frater, et ambo orti germana fuerant ducis"[870].  The chronology of her descen
2 CONC dants strongly suggests that Beatrix must have been born in [1005/10] and therefore was one of her parents' older children.  The primary source which confirms her name and second marriage has not yet been identified.  Beatrix is s
2 CONC hown as the daughter of Tancred by his first wife in Europäische Stammtafeln[871].  The basis for this is not known.  However, it appears more likely that she was the daughter of his second marriage if her estimated birth date ran
2 CONC ge is correct, especially in light of the approximate date of birth of her brother Robert "Guiscard" in [1020].  The Gesta Roberti Wiscardi names "Robertus de Scabioso Monte comes…Gosfredi frater, et ambo orti germana fuerant duci
