2 CONT 1.         ROBERT ([1020/25]-27 Jul 1080).  The Gesta Roberti Wiscardi names "Robertus de Scabioso Monte comes…Gosfredi frater, et ambo orti germana fuerant ducis"[874].  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet
2 CONC  been identified.  His birth date range is estimated on the basis of the tight suggested chronology of this family, bearing in mind the expected birth date range of Robert's grandson.  Conte di Matera.  The Chronicon Breve Normann
2 CONC icum records that "Robertus comes" captured "Materam" in 1064[875].  Conte di Montescaglioso.  "…Robertus de Monte Caveoso…" subscribed the charter dated 1053 (misdated) under which "Drogo…dux et magister Italie comesque Normannor
2 CONC um totius Apulie atque Calabrie" donated property for the soul of "fratris mei Guillelmi, Unfredi, Roberti"[876].  "…Robertus de Montescabioso…" was among the subscribers to a charter dated 1060 under which "Robertus dux Italie, A
2 CONC pulie et Calabrie atque Sicilie" donated "castrum Aquebelle" to the monastery of La Trinità at Cava[877].  "…Robertus de Monte Scabioso…" subscribed a charter dated Jun 1063 which declared the restitution of property to the monast
2 CONC ery of Banzi[878].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' AMELINA, daughter of BELGRANO Signor di Brindisi & his wife ---.  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.   Robert & his wife had one child: 
