2 CONT A French Nun?
2 CONT
2 CONT Another is from the family of Mulainaux in that Guitmund was a Spanish priest and Emma was a French nun. And the last is Guitmund comes from a line of Viking soldiers that invaded France with Rollo and produced Flour for the invad
2 CONC ing army.
2 CONT
2 CONT The owner of Bons Moulin (forest) and La Marche just west of the city of Moulin and the owner of the Castle of Moulin in Oren and possible the one in La Marche 
2 CONT
2 CONT She is related to ; Gondolfus Bishop of Tongres aka. Mummolin des Francis Ripuaires   Palatina of Angouleme  540 A.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband Guitmund's father is Eol de Molins 940 A.D. She is from the house of Lemoges  which mixed with the Limousin and eventually the la Marche What is interesting is Eol is a Greek name  . All this takes place during the Rom
2 CONC an occupation of Colonge ( Germania )
