2 CONT ===From Medlands:===
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NEAPOLITAN%20NOBILITY.htm#RodolfoMaccabeodiedafter1110
2 CONT
2 CONT ([1060/65]-[1115/19]).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  "Umfreda comes Montis Scaviosi" donated property to the monastery of "sancti Michahelis archangeli…in civitate vetera" by charte
2 CONC r dated Mar 1085, subscribed by "…Gualterius, Goffredus filius domini Umfredus comes, domino Rao Machabeo, Asegatto"[862].  Conte di Montescaglioso.  "Radulfus Machabeus…Montis Scaviosi dominus" donated property, for the souls of 
2 CONC "domini patris mei Umfredi et fratris mei Gosfredi et…Iordanis cognati mei…dominæ matris meæ Beatricis…et domine Judettæ socrus meæ…coniugis meæ dominæ Emmæ…Adeliciæ sororis meæ", by charter dated May 1099, subscribed by "Guidelmi
2 CONC  filii Umfredi, Roberti fratris sui, Asgatti, Raul filii Askettini"[863].  Roger II King of Sicily confirmed donations to Santa Maria Pistacci by "dni Radlfi Machabi bone memorie quondam Montis Scabiosi…senioris" by charter dated 
2 CONC 31 Aug 1133[864].  "Rogerius…Sicilie et Italie rex…Rogerii primi comitis heres et filius" confirmed past donations to the abbey of San Michele Arcangelo, Montescaglioso by (among others) "Emma comitissa civitatis Severiane sororis
2 CONC  nostre et…Umfredi et Radulphi Machabei dominorum prefate civitatis Severiana…" by charter dated Aug 1146[865].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (4 Sep 1087) [as her second husband,] EMMA of Sicily, [repudiated wife of GUILLAUME [VI] Comte d'Auvergne], daughter of ROGER I Count of Sicily & his first wife Judith d'Evreux [Normandie] ([1063]-after Aug 1119).  "Radulf
2 CONC us Machabeus…Montis Scaviosi dominus" donated property, for the souls of "domini patris mei Umfredi et fratris mei Gosfredi et…Iordanis cognati mei…dominæ matris meæ Beatricis…et domine Judettæ socrus meæ…coniugis meæ dominæ Emmæ…
2 CONC Adeliciæ sororis meæ", by charter dated May 1099[866].  "Emma comitissa…civitatis Severiane" donated property, for the souls of "viri mei domini Radulfi Machabei nostrorum filiorum", by charter dated Sep 1110, subscribed by "Roger
2 CONC ius civitatis Severiane dominus et filii Rodulfi Machabei Emme comitisse, Emma comitisse comitis Rogerii filiæ…"[867].  "Emma comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis Severiane domina" donated property to "monasterio sancti Micha
2 CONC elis archangeli", for "me et viri mei Randulfi Machabei nostrorum filiorum", by charter dated 1115, subscribed by "domini Rogerii Machabei prescripte comitisse filii, domine Adelicze iamdicte comitisse filie…"[868].  "Emma comitis
2 CONC sa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis Severiane domina…cum filio meo domino Rogerio Machabeo" donated property to "sancte Trinitatis…domus hospitalis" by charter dated Jul 1119[869].  "Emma comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis S
2 CONC everiane domina…cum filio meo domino Rogerio Machabeo" donated property to "domus hospitalis Sancti Iohannis Iherosolomitani" by charter dated Aug 1119[870].  "Rogerius…Sicilie et Italie rex…Rogerii primi comitis heres et filius" 
2 CONC confirmed past donations to St Mary Josephat, Jerusalem by (among others) "dna Emma soror nostra uxor quondam Radulfi Machabei" by charter dated 11 Oct 1144[871].  Rodolfo Macabeo & his wife had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *(a)       RUGGIERO MACABEO (-1124).  "Emma comitissa…civitatis Severiane" donated property, for the souls of "viri mei domini Radulfi Machabei nostrorum filiorum", by charter dated Sep 1110, subscribed by "Rogerius civitatis Seve
2 CONC riane dominus et filii Rodulfi Machabei Emme comitisse, Emma comitisse comitis Rogerii filiæ…"[872].  "Emma comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis Severiane domina" donated property to "monasterio sancti Michaelis archangeli", 
2 CONC for "me et viri mei Randulfi Machabei nostrorum filiorum", by charter dated 1115, subscribed by "domini Rogerii Machabei prescripte comitisse filii, domine Adelicze iamdicte comitisse filie…"[873].  Conte di Montescaglioso.  "Emma
2 CONC  comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis Severiane domina…cum filio meo domino Rogerio Machabeo" donated property to "sancte Trinitatis…domus hospitalis" by charter dated Jul 1119[874].  "Emma comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civ
2 CONC itatis Severiane domina…cum filio meo domino Rogerio Machabeo" donated property to "domus hospitalis Sancti Iohannis Iherosolomitani" by charter dated Aug 1119[875].  
2 CONT
2 CONT *(b)       ADELISIA (-after Jun 1140).  "Emma comitissa Rogerii comitis filia civitatis Severiane domina" donated property to "monasterio sancti Michaelis archangeli", for "me et viri mei Randulfi Machabei nostrorum filiorum", by 
2 CONC charter dated 1115, subscribed by "domini Rogerii Machabei prescripte comitisse filii, domine Adelicze iamdicte comitisse filie…"[876].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.  "Adelicia neptis
2 CONC  domini Rogerii…regis" donated the church of San Pietro di Golisano to the bishop of Cefalù by charter dated Jun 1140, subscribed by "Adam Avenel filius domine Adelicie…"[877].  "Adelicia domini…regis Rogerii neptis" donated a mil
2 CONC l to the church of Malvicino by charter dated 1156, subscribed by "Adam Avellus, Roberto de Sancto Iohanne…Rogerius de Roberto senescalcus…"[878].  William I King of Sicily confirmed a donation by "Adelicia" to the monastery of Sa
2 CONC nta Lucia in Adernò by charter dated to before May 1158[879].  m (1119) RAINALD Avenel, son of --- (-[Nov 1132]).  
2 CONT
2 CONT *(c)       JUDITH .  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified.  "Rogerius…Sicilie et Italie rex…Rogerii primi comitis heres et filius" confirmed past donations to the abbey of San Michele Arcange
2 CONC lo, Montescaglioso by (among others) "…Rogerii de Montibus unacum uxore eius Iudith dilecte neptis nostre" by charter dated Aug 1146[880].  m (before 1144) RUGGIERO de Montibus 
