2 CONT i)      '''   BARTHELEMY de Lucy''' (-after Dec 1200).  Conte di Paternò.  “Bartholomaus de Lucis...comes Paternionis...Desiderata uxor comitis Bartholomai de Lucis” donated property to “ecclesiam...Tremesteri...in territorio civi
2 CONC tatis Messina” by charter dated 9 Sep 1193, witnessed by “...Gerardus de Lucis miles...”[111].  “Bartholomaus de Lucis” donated property to “ecclesiam...Trimostere...in...civitatis Messana” by charter dated 4 Oct 1197[112].  “Bart
2 CONC holomeus de Lucy...comes Paternonis” donated property to S. Maria di Rocca by charter dated Dec 1200[113].  Emperor Friedrich II confirmed donations made by “Bartholomai de Lucis comitis quondam Paternionis...consanguinei...nostri
2 CONC ” to “monast. S. Maria Roccamatoris de tenimento Messana” by charter dated May 1221[114].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' DESIDERATA, daughter of --- (-Jan 1201).  “Bartholomaus de Lucis...comes Paternionis...Desiderata uxor comitis Bartholomai de Lucis” donated property to “ecclesiam...Tremesteri...in territorio civitatis Messina” by charter
2 CONC  dated 9 Sep 1193, witnessed by “...Gerardus de Lucis miles...”[115].  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT # '' Garufi says that she was “figliuola di Goffredo di Lecce conte di Montecaglioso”[116].  If Garufi is correct, she was Desiderata, daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Goffreso-III-di-Lecce-conte-di-Montescaglioso/60000001
2 CONC 90598004900 Goffredo] [III] di Lecce Conte di Montescaglioso & his wife ---.  ''
2 CONT
2 CONT #Pirro, on the other hand, records that “Bartholomæus de Lucy genere” married “Desideratam Gaufridi Conversani et Montis Caveosi comitis, Netique, Selasiani et Calatanixectæ domini, Sylvestri Marsicani tertiogeniti filiam”[117], w
2 CONC hich if correct means that she was Desiderata, daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Godefroy-D-altavilla-Gallucio/6000000003828302027 Geoffroy di Marsico Conte di Conversano] & his wife ---.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Neither author cites the primary source which confirms their assertions.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Barthelemy & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *(a)       MARGUERITE de Lucy (-after Jan 1199).
