1 NOTE {geni:about_me} YOLANDE van Gelre (->1122, bur Mons)
2 CONT d/o GERHARD von Wassenberg
2 CONT x [1107] BAUDOUIN III Comte de Hainaut,
2 CONT xx Godefrid de Bochesin castellano Valencensi
2 CONT *Godefrid
2 CONT *Berta x count of Duraz xx Gilles de Saint-Aubert
2 CONT **Gerard de Saint-Aubert
2 CONT **NN de Saint-Aubert x Nicholas of Barbencione
2 CONT
2 CONT GERHARD von Wassenberg, son of DIETRICH "Flamens" Graf [von Wassenberg] & his wife --- (-[before 1129 or 24 Oct [1131]]).  The Chronicon Huberti names "Gerardus et Gozwinus filius eius [=Theodericum]" in 1082[984].  Graf von Wasse
2 CONC nberg.  ...
2 CONT m [firstly] ---.  The name and origin of the wife of Gerhard is not known. 
2 CONT Gerhard & his [first] wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         JUTTA ([1087]-Rolduc 24 Jun 1151, bur Rolduc [Rode] abbey).  
2 CONT 2.         '''YOLANDE van Gelre''' (-after 1122, bur Mons).  The Chronicon Hanoniense records that "Balduinus comes Hanoniensis" married "Yolendem…comitis de Ghelra filiam", in a later passage naming them "Balduinus comes Hanonien
2 CONC sis, Balduini comitis et Yde comitisse filius" and "Yolendem comitis de Ghelra Gerardi filiam"[1005].  Heiress of Dodenweerd.  The Liber de Restauratione Sancti Martini Tornacensis names "Hiolendem, filiam Gerardi Babinbergensis c
2 CONC omitis" as wife Comte Baudouin, in breach of his vow to "Clementia Flandrensis comitissa" to marry "neptem suam" (who later married "Ludovico regi Francorum")[1006].  The Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines names "Yolendis de 
2 CONC Gelra" as mother of "comiti Balduini de Haynaco"[1007].  The Chronicon Hanoniense records that "Yoandis comitissa vidua" married secondly "Godefrido de Bochesin castellano Valencenensi", by whom she was mother of "filium…Godefridu
2 CONC m et filiam Bertam [uxorem] comiti de Duraz, deinde nupsit Egidio de Sancto Oberto a quo filium…Gerardum et filiam…[uxorem] Nicholao de Barbencione"[1008].  Regent of Hainaut.  m firstly ([1107]) BAUDOUIN III Comte de Hainaut, son
2 CONC  of BAUDOUIN II Comte de Hainaut & his wife Ida de Louvain (1088-1120).  m secondly GODEFROI [II] de Ribemont Châtelain de Valenciennes, son of GODEFROI [I] de Ribemont Châtelain de Valenciennes & his wife Agnes de Roucy. 
2 CONT 3.         GERHARD [II] (-24 Oct [1131], bur Wassenberg).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ''"Yoandis comitissa vidua" married secondly "Godefrido de Bochesin castellano Valencenensi", by whom she was mother of "filium…Godefridum et filiam Bertam [uxorem] comiti de Duraz, deinde nupsit Egidio de Sancto Oberto a quo fili
2 CONC um…Gerardum et filiam…[uxorem] Nicholao de Barbencione''
2 CONT >"Yoandis,  widowed countess," married secondly Godefrid de Bochesin castellano Valencensi, by whom she was mother of son...Godefrid and daughter Berta [wife] of the count of Duraz, who then  married Gilles de Saint-Aubert  from w
2 CONC hom she had son...Gerard and daughter...[ wife] of Nicholas of Barbencione
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/nfracado.htm#dauGillesSaintAubertMNicolasBarbancon
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/HOLLAND.htm#YolandeGelderndiedafter1122<br/>
2 CONT 2.         YOLANDE van Gelre (-after 1122, bur Mons).  The Chronicon Hanoniense records that "Balduinus comes Hanoniensis" married "Yolendem…comitis de Ghelra filiam", in a later passage naming them "Balduinus comes Hanoniensis, B
2 CONC alduini comitis et Yde comitisse filius" and "Yolendem comitis de Ghelra Gerardi filiam"[995].  Heiress of Dodenweerd.  The Liber de Restauratione Sancti Martini Tornacensis names "Hiolendem, filiam Gerardi Babinbergensis comitis"
2 CONC  as wife Comte Baudouin, in breach of his vow to "Clementia Flandrensis comitissa" to marry "neptem suam" (who later married "Ludovico regi Francorum")[996].  The Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines names "Yolendis de Gelra" a
2 CONC s mother of "comiti Balduini de Haynaco"[997].  The Chronicon Hanoniense records that "Yoandis comitissa vidua" married secondly "Godefrido de Bochesin castellano Valencenensi", by whom she was mother of "filium…Godefridum et fili
2 CONC am Bertam [uxorem] comiti de Duraz, deinde nupsit Egidio de Sancto Oberto a quo filium…Gerardum et filiam…[uxorem] Nicholao de Barbencione"[998].  Regent of Hainaut.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly ([1107]) BAUDOUIN III Comte de Hainaut, son of BAUDOUIN II Comte de Hainaut & his wife Ida de Louvain (1088-1120).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly GODEFROI [II] de Ribemont Châtelain de Valenciennes, son of GODEFROI [I] de Ribemont Châtelain de Valenciennes & his wife Agnes de Roucy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT Alternative Date of Birth:  1087 Alternative, but incorrect Birthplace:  Gelderland, Netherlands
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg845.htm Baldwin III of HAINAUT Count of Hainaut [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 was born 1087 in Mons, Hainaut, Belgium. He died 1120 in Mons, Hainaut, Belgium. Baldwin married Yol
2 CONC ande von WASSENBERG on 1107 in Mons, Hainaut, Belgium.
2 CONT
2 CONT Yolande von WASSENBERG [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 was born 1087 in , Gelderland, Netherlands. She married Baldwin III of HAINAUT Count of Hainaut on 1107 in Mons, Hainaut, Belgium.
2 CONT
