2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	i 	Baldwin IV "le Batisseur" of HAINAUT Count of Hainaut was born 1108 and died 8 Nov 1171.
2 CONT       		F 	ii 	Ida of HAINAUT was born 1110.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg886.htm#14150 Gerhard I von WASSENBERG Count of Guelders [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 was born 1055 in Wassenberg, Rheinland, Prussia. He died 24 Oct 1129 in , Gelderland, Nethe
2 CONC rlands. Gerhard married Clemence of POITOU on 1086 in , Gelderland, Netherlands.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clemence of POITOU [Parents] 1, 2, 3 was born 1059 in Poitou, Aquitaine, France. She died after 1129. Clemence married Gerhard I von WASSENBERG Count of Guelders on 1086 in , Gelderland, Netherlands.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Other marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT         LUXEMBOURG, Conrad I of
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	i 	Yolande von WASSENBERG was born 1087.
2 CONT       		F 	ii 	Jutta von WASSENBERG was born 1089 and died 24 Jun 1151.
2 CONT       		M 	iii 	Gerhard II von WASSENBERG Count of Zutphen was born 1091 and died 1133.
2 CONT
