2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Baldwin III, Count of Hainaut From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Baldwin III (1088-1120) was count of Hainaut from 1098 to his death. [edit]History
2 CONT
2 CONT He was son of Baldwin II, Count of Hainaut and Ida of Leuven. [edit]Family
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married with Yolande de Wassenberg, daughter of Gerald I (Gerhard)Flaminius de Wassenberg, Count of Geldern. Their children were: Baldwin IV, Count of Hainaut, married Alix (Adelaide) de Namur. Gerhard of Hainault, ancestor
2 CONC  of Counts of Dale. Gertrude/Ida of Hainault, married before 9 August 1138 Roger de Toeni of Conches and Flamsted. Richildis of Hainault, married: Thierry d'Avesnes; Everard II Radulf, Burgrave of Doornick.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Baldwin III, Count of Hainaut From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Baldwin III (1088-1120) was count of Hainaut from 1098 to his death. [edit]History
2 CONT
2 CONT He was son of Baldwin II, Count of Hainaut and Ida of Leuven. [edit]Family
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married with Yolande de Wassenberg, daughter of Gerald I (Gerhard)Flaminius de Wassenberg, Count of Geldern. Their children were: Baldwin IV, Count of Hainaut, married Alix (Adelaide) de Namur. Gerhard of Hainault, ancestor
2 CONC  of Counts of Dale. Gertrude/Ida of Hainault, married before 9 August 1138 Roger de Toeni of Conches and Flamsted. Richildis of Hainault, married: Thierry d'Avesnes; Everard II Radulf, Burgrave of Doornick.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Yolande was our ancestor through two distinct descent paths--through her daughter Gertrud and through her son Baldwin, each of whom was independently our ancestor.
2 CONT --------------------
