2 CONC Keu ac Mariam natam Matildis dominæ de Posaga, natæ comitissæ Viennensis" dated 15 Aug 1253, and the marriage licence for "Maria, nate quondam Calojohanni" dated 13 Jan 1254, the documents naming "imperatore Constantinopolitano, e
2 CONC iusdem Matildis avunculo"[669].  Ioannes & his wife had [two] children: 
