2 CONT 5.         '''OSHIN''' [IV] (-[7 Jan 1294/6 Jan 1295]).  Smbat Sparapet's Chronicle records that "the king…sent as a hostage Oshin, his own sister's son, the son of his brother Hetum, Raymond, and the son of Kostandin the king's f
2 CONC ather, Vasak lord of Chancho" to secure the release of his son Lewon from captivity in Egypt in [14 Jan 1268/12 Jan 1269][1136].  Lord of Asgouras and Marnick.  The Chronicle attributed to King Hethum II records that "paron Oshin 
2 CONC son of Kostandin lord of Lambron" died in [7 Jan 1294/6 Jan 1295][1137].  
