2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stefan_the_First-Crowned#Later_rule Later rule]
2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stefan_the_First-Crowned#Coronation_and_autocephaly Coronation and autocephaly]
