2 CONT ==VRATISLAV of Bohemia==
2 CONT ... m thirdly ([1062/63]) '''SWIĘTOSLAWA [Svatana] of Poland, daughter of KAZIMIERZ I KAROL "Odnowiciel/the Renewer" Prince of Poland & his wife Dobronega Maria Vladimirovna of Kiev ([1048]-1 Sep 1126). ''' The Annalista Saxo reco
2 CONC rds the marriage of Duke Vratislav with "Zuatavam, Kazimer ducis Polanorum filiam", after the death of his Hungarian wife[119].  The Chronica Boemorum records the marriage of "Wratislaus dux" and "Zustavam, Kazimir Poloniorum duci
2 CONC s natam, Bloezlai vero et Uladizlai germanam" after the death of "ductrix Adleyth"[120].  The Chronicæ Polanorum refers to an unnamed daughter of King Kazimierz who married "regi Bohemiæ"[121].  The Annales Gradicenses record that
2 CONC  in 1087 "dux Boemie…Wratislaus" was anointed as king and "uxor eius Zuslava" as queen[122].  The Monachi Sazavensis Continuatio Cosmæ; records the death "Kal Sep 1126" of "Zvatava regina mater Sobezlai ducis"[123].  The Annales G
2 CONC radicenses record the death in 1126 of "Zuatava regina"[124].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Vratislav II & his third wife had five children:
2 CONT *5.         BOLESLAV (-11 Aug 1091).  ...
2 CONT *6.         BOŘIWOJ ([1065]-2 Feb 1124, bur Prague St Veit).  ...
2 CONT *7.         VLADISLAV (-12 Apr 1125, bur Prague St Maria).  ...
2 CONT *8.         SOBĚSLAV UDALRICH ([1075]-14 Feb 1140).  ...
2 CONT *9.         JUDITH (-17 Dec 1108).  
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vratislaus II of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1062, Vratislaus married a third time to Świętosława I of Bohemia, a daughter of Casimir I of Poland. They had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Boleslaus (-1091)
2 CONT
2 CONT Borivoj II of Bohemia (c. 1064-February 2, 1124), Duke of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladislaus I of Bohemia (-April 12, 1125), Duke of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT Sobeslav I of Bohemia (-February 14, 1140), Duke of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith (c. 1066-9 December 1108), married to Wiprecht de Groitzsch
2 CONT
