3 TEXT After the death of Dirk III on 27 May 1039 , [2] his wife went back to Saxony , where she died on March 31, 1044. Dirk III is buried in the Abbey of Egmond . Othilde was buried in Quedlinburg.
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT Dirk III's wife was Othelhilde (c. 985 - Quedlinburg , 9 March 1043/44). [8] There is no certainty about her origin. If she was a daughter of Duke Bernhard I of Saxony , her son Floris married his full cousin. The father is also k
4 CONC nown as Bernard I van Brandenburg , the Margrave of the Noordmark .
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT From the marriage of Dirk with Othelhilde four children were born:
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT Dirk IV
4 CONT
4 CONT Floris I
4 CONT
4 CONT Bertrada , who married Diederik II van Katlenburg
4 CONT
4 CONT Swanhilde , who married Emmo van Loon
