1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Igor''' (Игорь, Igor, Ingvar, Ігор, Ihor, Игорь, Ігар, Ihar) is the first of the Russian princes named in a non-Russian source.
2 CONT
2 CONT Igor is remembered as the son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Rurik-Founder-of-the-Rurikid-Dynasty/6000000014131379071 '''Rurik], the progenitor of the [https://www.geni.com/projects/Rurik-Dynasty-862-1598/83 '''Rurikid] dynasty, 
2 CONC though inconsistencies in chronology raise some issues with this. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Igor's marriage to [https://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Olga-Grand-Duchess-of-Kiev/6000000005406862960 '''Saint Olga] and their son, https://www.geni.com/people/Sviatoslav-Igorevich-Grand-Prince-of-Kiev/6000000005407291287, are well
2 CONC  documented in various sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT For a brief overview of Igor see [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igor_of_Kiev '''Wikipedia].
2 CONT
2 CONT For a detailed description of the existent sources on Igor see [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/RUSSIA,%20Rurik.htm#_Toc481496211 '''Medlands].
2 CONT
2 CONT For a detailed analysis of Igor and his family and the geopolitical framework see [http://www.friesian.com/russia.htm#kiev '''this webpage].
