1 NOTE 443618160. Fyrst Igor I RURIKSON av Kiev(16952) was born in 875.(16953) He was a Fyrste in 912 in Kiev.(16954) He died in 945. (16955) Døde i kamp med den slaviske stamme Drevlijaerne. He was married to Olga den Hellige N.NSDTR. (
2 CONC 16956)
