2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Alexander Antonov's novel "Princess Olga"
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Boris Vasiliev's "Olga, Queen of the Rus"
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Victor Gretskov's "Princess Olga, Bulgarian Princess"
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Michael Kazovsky's "Daughter of the Empress"
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Alexey Karpov's "Princess Olga" (Series ZHZL) published by the Young Guard in 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Svetlana Kaidash-Lakshin "Princess Olga" (a historical novel)
2 CONT
