2 CONT *1.         [daughter ([969]-after 987). ... m (end 985, divorced [986/87]) as his second wife, BOLESŁAW of Poland, son of MIESZKO I Prince of Poland & his second wife Dobrava [Dobroslawa] of Bohemia ([967]-17 Jun 1025).
2 CONT *2.         [daughter ([971]-).  ... m (shortly before 985) [SIZZO] Graf in Thuringia & his wife ---.]
2 CONT *3.         daughter ([973]-after 988).  ... m (987, repudiated 988) as his first wife, GAVRIIL RADOMIR of the Bulgarians, son of SAMUIL Tsar of the Bulgarians & his wife Agatha Chryselia (-murdered Autumn 1015). Prince Géza & his
2 CONC  [first/second] wife had one child:
2 CONT *4.         VAJK (Esztergom [967/75]-Buda 15 Aug 1038, bur Székesfehérvár).  ... István received a royal crown from Pope Sylvester II and was crowned ISTVÁN I King of Hungary 25 Dec 1000 or 1 Jan 1001.  -        see below. Prince 
2 CONC Géza & his second wife had [three] children:
2 CONT *5.         daughter ([987]-). ...  m SHABA [leader of the Kabars], son of ---.  Comes palatii [Palatine][297] of King István in 1001.  Shaba & his wife had one known child:
2 CONT **a)         ABA (-murdered Feldebrö [Jul/Aug] 1044, bur Sáros Abbey).  ...
2 CONT *6.         daughter ([989]-1026). ...  m (1009) PIETRO OTTONE Orseolo, son of PIETRO Orseolo II Doge of Venice & his wife Maria --- ([989]-Constantinople 1031).  -        see below (after the descendants of King István I).
2 CONT *7.         [daughter . ... She became a nun as SCHOLASTICA.  Abbess of Somlóvàsárhely.]
