3 CONT Children of Boleslaw III, Duke of Poland and Salome von Berg -1. Heinrich, Duke of Sandomir (2) d. 1166 -2. Richza of Poland+ (1) b. 1116, d. a 1155 -3. Boleslaw IV, Duke of Cracow (2) b. 1125, d. 1173 -4. Mieszko III, Duke of Pol
3 CONC and+ (2) b. 1126, d. 1202 -5. Dobronega of Poland+ b. c 1128, d. a 26 Oct 1147 -6. Casimir II, Duke of Cracow+ (2) b. 1138, d. 1194
