0 @N6000000007329725958@ NOTE [James A. Stephens, Nov 15 '95 soc.gene.med <jstevens -at-   iquest.net>]
1 CONT :  QUESTION :  The Royal database agrees with Weis that Hugh's wife was
1 CONT Stephanie, or Etienette of Longwy, but does not list parents for her.
1 CONT 'Colonial & Revolutionary Lineages in America', Vol 5, has Hugh's   wife
1 CONT was  ETIENETTE, dau of RAIMOND BERENGER II 'TOWHEAD', COUNT OF BARCELONA
1 CONT &  CARCASSONE (d. 1082) and MATILDA, dau of ROBERTO GISCARD. Could these
