1 CONC ; Saint Gellert) from the age of 15 to 23. He was intended to be the next monarch of Hungary, his father wrote admonitions to prepare him for this task, but he died at a young age, at hunting, by a boar. For his pious life and pur
1 CONC ity, he was canonized in 1083.
1 CONT
