1 CONC feated, Yaroslav managed to conclude the war with a favourable treaty and prestigious marriage of his son Vsevolod to the emperor's daughter. It has been suggested that the peace was so advantageous because the Kievans had succeed
1 CONC ed in taking a key Byzantine possession in Crimea, Chersones.
