1 CONT Chronology:
1 CONT 1016-1019 AD - Yaroslav organizes two campaigns with Varangian and Novgorodian troops to unseat Svyatopolk from the throne at Kyiv
1 CONT 1020 AD - Yaroslav's son Vladimir is born. Elias was born while Yaroslav was still at Novgorod and was placed on command at Novgorod when Yaroslav left, but died that same year.
