1 CONT Humphrey were the other two original brothers. Later, half-brothers Robert
1 CONT and Roger followed.
0 @N6000000002322298287@ NOTE Roger went to Italy to aid his brother Robert in his conquest of Calabria
1 CONT from the Byznatines (1060), then capturing Palermo in 1072. In 1098 Roger
1 CONT received the title of apostolic legate from Pope Urban II, which gave him
1 CONT control of the church of Sicily. At his death, Roger had created a
1 CONT centralized, efficient government, where his authority of the count was
1 CONT unchallenged. He was a ruler for whom diplomacy was more of a natural weapon
1 CONT than the sword, and gold, a more effective currency than blood.
