0 @N6000000000945065942@ NOTE Johannes (Ioannis) var hoffmarskalk ved det bysantiske hoff. 
1 CONT Han ble født i Kastamon i Lilleasien, hvor komnenerne hadde store familieeiendommer.
1 CONT Han ble etter farens død sammen med sin bror Isak I oppdratt under keiserens oppsikt og
1 CONT utdannet i klosteret Studion, dengang et hovedsete for lærde.
1 CONT Broren Isak ble keiser 02.09.1057, men oppga kronen på grunn av sykdom i 1059.
1 CONT Han valgte da, i stedet for sin bror Johannes, sin venn og førsteminister Konstantin X Dukas
1 CONT som etterfølger.
1 CONT Johannes var statholder i Bysants i 1057. Da Isak abdiserte i 1059 og gikk i kloster,
1 CONT trakk han seg også tilbake fra det offentlige liv og døde i kloster.
0 @N6000000002187821161@ NOTE domestikos ton scholon Ioannes I Komnenos1
1 CONT b. 1015, d. 12 July 1067, #5632
1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT      domestikos ton scholon Ioannes I Komnenos was born in 1015. He was the son of patrikios Manuel Erotikos Komnenos.2,3 He married Anna Dalassena, daughter of Alexios Pharo and N. N. Dalassena, circa 1042.2,4 He was served as Cu
1 CONC ropalates and Grand Domestic before 1067. He died on 12 July 1067 at age 52 years.2,4  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT      Children of domestikos ton scholon Ioannes I Komnenos and Anna Dalassena: 
1 CONT   sebastokrator Isaakios Komnenos   b. c 1047, d. bt 1102 - 1104 
1 CONT   protostrator Manuel Komnenos   b. c 1048, d. 1071 
1 CONT   Alexios I Komnenos, basileus Rhomaiôn+   b. 1048, d. 15 Aug 1118 
1 CONT   Theodora Komnene+   b. c 1053 
1 CONT
1 CONT [S204] Roderick W. Stuart, Royalty for Commoners: The Complete Lineage of John of Gaunt, Son of Edward III, Kings of England, and Queen Philippa (.: ., 3rd Ed., 1998), 111-33. Hereinafter cited as RfC. 
1 CONT [S269] C. W. Previté-Orton The Shorter Cambridge Medieval History, Volume 1, the Later Roman Empire to the Twelfth Century, 1 (Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 1978), pg. 536, genealogy table 15, (a) the House of Ducas and C
1 CONC omnenus.. Hereinafter cited as sCMH I. 
1 CONT [S710] Charles P. Keith, The Ancestry of Benjamin Harrison, President of the United States of America 1889-1893, in Chart Form Showing Also the Descendants of William Henry Harrison, President of the United States of America in 18
1 CONC 41, and Notes on Families Related (Philadelphia, PA: J. B. Lippincott Company, 1893). Hereinafter cited as Harrison Ancestry. 
1 CONT [S1034] Krew Bagratydów Genealogiczne zwiazki Rurykowiczów i Komnenów z Bagratydami w XII wieku, online http://www.bkpan.poznan.pl/JW70/kata.htm. Hereinafter cited as Prinke. 
