1 CONT [S1176] Www Serbian Medieval History, online http://www.suc.org/culture/history/Serb_History/index.html, Rulers of the Land. 
0 @N6000000002187891955@ NOTE Zavida Vukanovici
1 CONT b. circa 1113?, #16836
1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT      Zavida Vukanovici was of a side branch of the Vukanovici family.1 He was born circa 1113?. He was the son of Urosh I, veliki zupan Rashka and Anna Diogenissa.2 He was deprived of his portion, of his father's Raska territory, 
1 CONC by his brothers and banished in 1131.2 He retired to Ribnica, the birthplace of his family, where Stefan Nemanja, his fourth or fifth son, was born.2  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT      Children of Zavida Vukanovici: 
1 CONT   veliki zupan Raske Stefan Tihomir Vukanovici   b. c 1136? 
1 CONT   veliki zupan Raske Stefan Nemnja Vukanovici+   b. 1141, d. 1200 
1 CONT
