1 CONT Holy Roman Emperor.  Succeeded his father at age 6, but during most of his
1 CONT minority, his mother ruled in his name. During his reign there was a great
1 CONT struggle for temporal power in the Empire between the Papacy and the
1 CONT Holy Roman Emperors.
