1 CONT Marriages and Children
1 CONT
1 CONT St. Vladimir married in  to  Rogneda von Polotzk, a Nun and a daughter of Rognald of Polotzk, in 980.  Rogneda died in 1002.  St. Vladimir and Rogneda the Nun had the following children:
1 CONT Yaroslav I the Wise, Grand Prince of Kiev
1 CONT Vissavald of Kiev
1 CONT Iasaslav, Prince of Polotzk
1 CONT Mtsislav, Grand Prince Tschernigow
1 CONT Premislava
1 CONT Sviataslav
1 CONT Sudislav, Prince of Pskow
1 CONT Wizeslau, Prince of Novgorod
1 CONT
1 CONT St. Vladimir married after 1011 to Malfreda of Bohemia, a daughter of Kuno, Count of Ohningen, by Richilde who was a daughter of Otto I the Great, King of Germany. They had a daughter:
1 CONT Dobroniega who married in 1038 to King Casimir I, King of Poland.
1 CONT
