1 CONT Detail of the Millenium of Russia monument in Novgorod (1862)representing St Vladimir and his family.Saint Vladimir Svyatoslavichthe Great (c.958–1015) was the grand prince of Kiev who converted toChristianity in 988, and proceede
1 CONC d to baptise the whole Kievan Rus.His name is known in three traditions: in Old East Slavic and modernUkrainian as Volodymer (?????????), in Old Church Slavonic and modernRussian as Vladimir (????????), and in the Norse and modern
1 CONC Scandinavian languages as Valdemar.
1 CONT
