1 CONC ow Crusader Emich of Leiningen joined Hugh'sarmy after Emich was defeated by the Hungarians, whose land he hadbeen pillaging. Hugh crossed the Adriatic from Bari in southern Italy,but many of his ships were destroyed in a storm of
