1 CONT byname) and also one of the most statesmanlike. Strict just laws were passed
1 CONT to preserve the state, the church, the central government, and private
1 CONT property and to strengthen the economic and military position of Hungary. He
1 CONT was noted particularly for enacting a law forbidding trials of wiches, whose
1 CONT existence he denied.
