1 CONT Roman Empire to the west. Prince Vratislav II obtained from the Holy Roman
1 CONT Emperor Henry IV the title of king as a personal (not Hereditary) privilege,
1 CONT and Vladislav II (1140-1173) was awarded the royal crown on the same basis by
1 CONT Emperor Frederick I Barbarossa. From this point in time written history is
1 CONT lacking. Therefore, the next member of the monachy known, ouside of a mention
1 CONT of Prince Vladislav II, 1140-1173, is Otakar I, 1198-1230. See #1857.
