0 @N6000000004533089341@ NOTE He [Hugh of Kevelioc" married, in 1169, Bertrade, then aged 14 (theKing giving her away in marriage "because she was his own cousin "),daughter of Simon de Montfort, Count D'EVREUX by his 1st wife, Maud.He died at Leek, co. Staffo
1 CONC rd, 30 June 1181, aged about 34 and wasburied at St. Werburg's, Chester. His widow died 1227, aged about 7I.[Complete Peerage III:167, XIV:170, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)]
