0 @N6000000005598872603@ NOTE It is reported that Bertrade ultimately deserted her husband Fulk and became the mistress of Philip I of France.  Her influence over Philip is reported to have been 'notorious'.  She was openly hostile to the t hrone and was even 
1 CONC accused of having tried to poison Philippe's succes sor Louis VI.  However at one time, historians also credit Bertrade wi th siding with Louis VI against his father.
