0 @N6000000000437172991@ NOTE Name Prefix:<NPFX> Tveskjaeg Name Suffix:<NSFX> I, Of Denmark "Forkbeard" King of Denmark (c. 987–1014) and Viking conqueror of Norway and England. or Sweyn Forkbeard.   He rebelled against his father, Harald Bluetooth (987), chas
1 CONC inghim from Denmark. With Swedish and Norwegian allies, he defeated Olaf I Tryggvason (c. 1000), becoming virtual ruler of Norway. Sweyn led raids on England in1003–04 and became king after a successful military campaign in 1013, 
1 CONC forcing Ethelred II  into exile. Norway reverted to Norwegian rule after Sweyn's death,but the Anglo-Danish empire continued under his son Canute the Great .
